  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For Every Child, Early Childhood Care and Education in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2027, More children between the ages of 3~5 years, particularly those in remote areas, have access to and are enrolled in quality early childhood education programmes and are ready for primary school.2027&#xB144;&#xAE4C;&#xC9C0; &#xC9C0;&#xBC29; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC758; &#xC601;&#xC720;&#xC544;&#xB97C; &#xD3EC;&#xD568;&#xD558;&#xC5EC; &#xBCF4;&#xB2E4; &#xB9CE;&#xC740; 3-5&#xC138; &#xC601;&#xC720;&#xC544;&#xC5D0;&#xAC8C; &#xC591;&#xC9C8;&#xC758; &#xAD50;&#xC721;&#xC5D0; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xAE30;&#xD68C;&#xB97C; &#xC81C;&#xACF5; &#xBC0F; &#xCD08;&#xB4F1;&#xAD50;&#xC721;&#xC900;&#xBE44; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children irrespective of gender, ability, socio-economic and geographic status are in age-appropriate learning pathways (traditional or innovative alternate pathways) stimulated by positive policy environment and social norms.</narrative>
  </description>
